VALUES
  ('A','aCoin','A','Attention','Verified human attention, presence, viewing quality, focus, and honest engagement with content, offers, learning, creators, brands, and platform experiences.','core_economic',FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','You earn aCoins when the system verifies that you truly paid attention.','Raw attention signal. May convert only after attention verification, fraud checks, campaign rules, and trust gates.','A is the coin of attention. It proves the user truly looked.'),
  ('B','bCoin','B','Belonging','Healthy community membership, constructive participation, loyalty to safe groups, and social continuity.','identity_trust_governance',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','bCoins show healthy belonging inside communities, cohorts, creator circles, and local groups.','Community health and belonging signal. Used for group access, social permissions, and community reputation.','B is the coin of belonging. It proves the group is better because the user is there.'),
  ('C','cCoin','C','Creation','Valid creative production, content creation, media creation, courses, tools, assets, and usable output.','creator_contribution',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'public','cCoins show that you created something real and valid.','Creation existence and validity signal. Requires rights checks, spam checks, and artifact verification.','C is the coin of making. It proves the user added something to the world.'),
  ('D','dCoin','D','Discipline','Healthy consistency, follow-through, routines, habit stability, and responsible repetition.','human_development',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','dCoins show healthy consistency toward valuable goals.','Habit and streak integrity signal. Must avoid addiction loops and empty streak farming.','D is the coin of return. It proves the user came back with purpose.'),
  ('E','eCoin','E','Engagement','Meaningful active interaction: comments, saves, shares, replies, follows, polls, quizzes, and community participation.','core_economic',FALSE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','eCoins show meaningful engagement, not spam.','Active engagement signal. Conversion requires quality, anti-spam, anti-brigading, and trust checks.','E is the coin of response. It proves the user touched the world back.'),
  ('F','fCoin','F','Focus','Sustained focus, deep attention, session integrity, and distraction resistance.','human_development',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','fCoins show that your attention stayed stable and intentional.','Deep session-quality signal. Used as multiplier for learning, work, and attention sessions.','F is the coin of mental gravity. It proves the user did not only look — they stayed.'),
  ('G','gCoin','G','Growth','Measured improvement over time, progress, practice gains, and personal development.','human_development',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','gCoins show verified improvement over time.','Before-effort-after progression signal. Conversion only through funded growth challenges.','G is the coin of becoming. It measures the distance between who the user was and who they are becoming.'),
  ('H','hCoin','H','Help','Useful assistance, guidance, mentorship, support, problem-solving, and care.','creator_contribution',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','hCoins show that your help was useful to another person.','Verified helpfulness signal. Requires recipient outcome, quality, anti-collusion, and abuse checks.','H is the coin of help. It proves value passed from one human to another.'),
  ('I','iCoin','I','Identity','Verified identity, stable human presence, account legitimacy, personal continuity, and economic eligibility.','core_economic',TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','iCoins are identity-linked value attached to a real accountable human.','Genesis coin. Anchors value, eligibility, wallet legitimacy, identity continuity, and trusted economic participation.','I is the coin of the self. It proves value belongs to a real human, not a shadow.'),
  ('J','jCoin','J','Judgment','Decision quality, discernment, moderation accuracy, review accuracy, and responsible choices.','identity_trust_governance',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','jCoins show reliable decision quality.','Decision reliability signal. Used for moderation weight, review credibility, and dispute influence.','J is the coin of discernment. It proves the user can be trusted not only to act — but to decide.'),
  ('K','kCoin','K','Knowledge','Verified knowledge, factual understanding, recall, applied information, and domain literacy.','human_development',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','kCoins show what you actually know and can use.','Retained knowledge signal. Verified through recall, explanation, application, and source integrity.','K is the coin of knowing. It proves the user kept the truth and can use it.'),
  ('L','lCoin','L','Learning','Verified learning, comprehension, practice, course progress, and skill formation.','human_development',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','lCoins show verified learning, not just watching educational content.','Learning process signal. Requires comprehension, recall, application, or progress verification.','L is the coin of learning. It proves attention became knowledge.'),
  ('M','mCoin','M','Mastery','Deep competence, repeated excellence, verified expertise, and durable skill.','human_development',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'public','mCoins show repeated high-quality performance over time.','Durable skill signal. Requires repeated proof under meaningful difficulty.','M is the coin of mastery. It proves the user can actually do this.'),
  ('N','nCoin','N','Nobility','Verified pro-social action, fairness, protection, sacrifice, responsibility, and integrity.','identity_trust_governance',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','nCoins show verified noble action, not public performance.','Moral/pro-social signal. Must resist virtue-signaling, staged generosity, and false reporting.','N is the coin of nobility. It proves the user created value without extraction.'),
  ('O','oCoin','O','Originality','Novelty, authorship, invention, remix quality, and non-duplicative creative contribution.','creator_contribution',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'public','oCoins show how original your contribution is.','Originality signal. Requires plagiarism checks, AI-content labeling, rights validation, and remix rules.','O is the coin of originality. It proves the user added something new.'),
  ('P','pCoin','P','Presence','Verified physical or digital attendance, check-ins, live participation, and showing up.','identity_trust_governance',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','pCoins show verified presence in meaningful places or moments.','Attendance and presence signal. Requires anti-spoofing, GPS/session proof, and privacy controls.','P is the coin of presence. It proves the user was there.'),
  ('Q','qCoin','Q','Quality','Quality of contribution, engagement, creation, help, learning, participation, and reviews.','creator_contribution',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','qCoins show that what you did was actually good.','Value-density signal. Used as multiplier and anti-spam filter across the economy.','Q is the coin of excellence. It proves what the user did was real and good.'),
  ('R','rCoin','R','Reputation','Long-term reliability, credibility, review integrity, fulfilled commitments, and social proof.','identity_trust_governance',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','rCoins show repeated reliability over time.','Reputation graph signal. Used for marketplace confidence, review weight, and creator ranking.','R is the shadow your actions leave behind.'),
  ('S','sCoin','S','Safety','Safe behavior, risk reduction, protection of minors, scam resistance, and ecosystem safety.','system_protective',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','sCoins show responsible safety contribution.','Safety and risk-reduction signal. Used for moderation, minor protections, fraud controls, and feature gates.','S is the shield coin. It proves the user protects the world where value lives.'),
  ('T','tCoin','T','Trust','Trustworthiness, honesty, low-risk behavior, identity stability, payment reliability, and permission safety.','identity_trust_governance',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','tCoins show how much the system can safely allow.','Permission and risk gate. Controls withdrawals, conversions, campaign eligibility, sensitive access, and payout speed.','T is the key coin. It decides how much reality the system is willing to open.'),
  ('U','uCoin','U','User Value','Accumulated long-term human value created through verified actions, trust, helpfulness, learning, originality, and contribution.','identity_trust_governance',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','uCoins represent the value you build over time.','Long-term human value accumulator. Drives rare rewards, grants, protection, boosts, access, and platform citizenship.','U is the coin of accumulated human value. One day, value can return to the human who built it.'),
  ('V','vCoin','V','Value','Spendable platform value, verified rewards, campaign-funded earnings, creator income, and usable purchasing power.','core_economic',TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','vCoins are usable platform value after rewards become safe to spend.','Spendable platform value. Governed by source lots, pending holds, settlement, chargeback risk, age rules, and trust gates.','V is the coin of usable value.'),
  ('W','wCoin','W','Work','Verified effort, task completion, labor contribution, campaign work, service work, and useful execution.','core_economic',FALSE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','wCoins show completed useful work.','Verified task-completion signal. Conversion requires task review, quality checks, labor rules, and settlement.','W is the coin of effort made real.'),
  ('X','xCoin','X','Exchange','Fair exchange, transaction integrity, marketplace reliability, escrow behavior, and clean value transfer.','core_economic',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,'tier_only','xCoins show clean, fair exchange.','Marketplace integrity signal. Affects escrow, dispute weight, transaction limits, and settlement speed.','X is the coin of clean exchange. It proves value moved without betrayal.'),
  ('Y','yCoin','Y','Yield','Durable positive return from past actions, lasting contribution, creator output yield, learning yield, and community yield.','creator_contribution',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'private','yCoins show that something you did kept creating value over time.','Durable value signal. Must not be framed as interest/passive income. Converts only from funded reward pools.','Y is the coin of lasting value. It proves what the user did kept giving.'),
  ('Z','zCoin','Z','Zenith','Peak achievement, rare excellence, elite trust, exceptional mastery, and top-tier identity status.','elite_achievement',FALSE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,TRUE,'public','zCoins show peak verified achievement.','Rare peak-status signal. Non-farmable, domain-specific, protected, and manually/audit verified.','Z is the summit coin. It proves the user did not only grow — they arrived.')
